      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-6",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "He found the box beside the recycling bin. Mateo looked at the sunny backyard. “Or a flying machine,” he said. They taped on wings and named it The Sky Spark.",
          "x": 10,
          "y": 35,
          "w": 80,
          "h": 25,
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "color": "",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pg-mig-10",
      "background": {
        "type": "color",
        "value": "#EAF6FB"
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-8",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Chike climbed in and pushed off with his feet. The box tipped gently into the grass. The wings folded.",
          "x": 10,
          "y": 35,
          "w": 80,
          "h": 25,
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "color": "",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-9",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/assets/characters/mateo.jpg",
          "alt": "Mateo watching the first test",
          "placement": "bottom-half"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pg-mig-12",
      "background": {
        "type": "color",
        "value": "#FFF6E2"
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-11",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "“Our first test taught us something,” Mateo said. “The wings need more support.”",
          "x": 10,
          "y": 35,
          "w": 80,
          "h": 25,
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "color": "",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pg-mig-14",
      "background": {
        "type": "color",
        "value": "#EAF6FB"
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-13",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "They built a wider base, added cardboard braces, and tested every piece. The Sky Spark did not truly fly — but it rolled beautifully down the hill.",
          "x": 10,
          "y": 35,
          "w": 80,
          "h": 25,
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "color": "",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pg-mig-17",
      "background": {
        "type": "gradient",
        "value": "#0F6E9E,#0A5280,135"
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-15",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "What Chike and Mateo learned",
          "x": 10,
          "y": 20,
          "w": 80,
          "h": 10,
          "style": "tag",
          "align": "left",
          "color": "",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-16",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "“We did not make a flying box,” Chike said. “We made a better idea.”",
          "x": 10,
          "y": 35,
          "w": 80,
          "h": 25,
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "color": "",
          "locked": false
