        "type": "color",
        "value": "#FFF6E2"
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-45",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "“Could these tubes be supports?” Kylah asked. “And this could be a stronger base,” said Chike. Mateo took a moment, then nodded. “Let us test it.”",
