          "y": 20,
          "w": 80,
          "h": 10,
          "style": "tag",
          "align": "left",
          "color": "",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "id": "ly-mig-50",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "“It is still my city,” Mateo said. “It is just better, because my friends helped build it.”",
